{"s":111,"v":[{"t":"May the hands of Abū Lahab be ruined, and ruined is he.","w":[["تَبَّتْ","Perish","tabbat",""],["يَدَآ","(the) hands","yadā",""],["أَبِى","(of) Abu","abī",""],["لَهَبٍۢ","Lahab","lahabin",""],["وَتَبَّ","and perish he","watabba","",[["وَ",1],["تَبَّ",2242]]]]},{"t":"His wealth will not avail him or that which he gained.","w":[["مَآ","Not","mā",""],["أَغْنَىٰ","(will) avail","aghnā",""],["عَنْهُ","him","ʿanhu","",[["عَنْ",34],["هُ",5]]],["مَالُهُۥ","his wealth","māluhu","",[["مَالُ",145],["هُۥ",5]]],["وَمَا","and what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["كَسَبَ","he earned","kasaba",""]]},{"t":"He will [enter to] burn in a Fire of [blazing] flame","w":[["سَيَصْلَىٰ","He will be burnt","sayaṣlā","",[["سَ",118],["يَصْلَىٰ",699]]],["نَارًۭا","(in) a Fire","nāran",""],["ذَاتَ","of","dhāta",""],["لَهَبٍۢ","Blazing Flames","lahabin",""]]},{"t":"And his wife [as well] - the carrier of firewood.","w":[["وَٱمْرَأَتُهُۥ","And his wife","wa-im'ra-atuhu","",[["وَ",1],["ٱمْرَأَتُ",417],["هُۥ",5]]],["حَمَّالَةَ","(the) carrier","ḥammālata",""],["ٱلْحَطَبِ","(of) firewood","l-ḥaṭabi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَطَبِ",2318]]]]},{"t":"Around her neck is a rope of [twisted] fiber.","w":[["فِى","In","fī",""],["جِيدِهَا","her neck","jīdihā","",[["جِيدِ",3354],["هَا",22]]],["حَبْلٌۭ","(will be) a rope","ḥablun",""],["مِّن","of","min",""],["مَّسَدٍۭ","palm-fiber","masadin",""]]}]}